---
const title = "GRIDFORM Kitchens | Fictional Remodeling Concept";
const description = "A crisp editorial kitchen remodeling website concept by PixelFox.design.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#e63b2e" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://pixelfox.design/concepts/kitchen/" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://pixelfox.design/images/gridform/hero-1800.webp" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://pixelfox.design/concepts/kitchen/" />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>

    <div class="concept-bar">
      <a href="/">A PixelFox.design concept</a>
      <p>Fictional studio, illustrative projects, no remodeling services offered</p>
    </div>

    <header class="site-header" id="top">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="GRIDFORM Kitchens home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">GF</span>
        <span><strong>GRIDFORM</strong><small>Kitchens / Spatial systems</small></span>
      </a>
      <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="#rooms">Rooms</a>
        <a href="#system">System</a>
        <a href="#scope">Scope</a>
        <a href="#process">Process</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="header-cta" href="#scope">Start a room <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></a>
      <details class="mobile-menu">
        <summary aria-label="Open menu"><span></span></summary>
        <nav aria-label="Mobile navigation">
          <a href="#rooms">Rooms</a>
          <a href="#system">System</a>
          <a href="#scope">Scope</a>
          <a href="#process">Process</a>
          <a href="#contact">Start a room</a>
        </nav>
      </details>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <figure class="hero-media">
          <picture>
            <source sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 100vw" srcset="/images/gridform/hero-900.avif 900w, /images/gridform/hero-1800.avif 1800w" type="image/avif" />
            <source sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 100vw" srcset="/images/gridform/hero-900.webp 900w, /images/gridform/hero-1800.webp 1800w" type="image/webp" />
            <img alt="Warm white GRIDFORM concept kitchen with a brushed metal island and signal-red cabinet wall" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1024" src="/images/gridform/hero-1800.webp" width="1536" />
          </picture>
          <figcaption>Original AI-generated concept photography</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="hero-code" aria-hidden="true"><strong>GF</strong><span>06</span></div>
        <div class="hero-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Kitchen renovation, edited</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Keep the room.<br /><span>Change how it works.</span></h1>
          <p>GRIDFORM is a fictional remodeling system for decisive rooms: useful layouts, exact material choices, and a scope that stays readable.</p>
          <a class="button button--signal" href="#scope">Sketch your scope <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="method-rail" aria-label="Concept remodeling method">
        <p><span>01</span><strong>Measure</strong><small>Read the existing room</small></p>
        <p><span>02</span><strong>Edit</strong><small>Remove wasted movement</small></p>
        <p><span>03</span><strong>Make</strong><small>Build one clear system</small></p>
        <p><span>04</span><strong>Fit</strong><small>Finish every junction</small></p>
      </section>

      <section class="manifesto section" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
        <p class="section-code">01 / Position</p>
        <h2 id="manifesto-title">A renovation should feel resolved before demolition begins.</h2>
        <div>
          <p>Good kitchens are not assembled from trends. They are edited around reach, light, storage, movement, and the few materials worth living with every day.</p>
          <a class="line-link" href="#rooms">See the room studies <span aria-hidden="true">&#8595;</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rooms" id="rooms" aria-labelledby="rooms-title">
        <header class="rooms-head section">
          <p class="section-code">02 / Room studies</p>
          <h2 id="rooms-title">One system.<br />Three attitudes.</h2>
          <p>Each fictional study uses the same material family differently. The result is a collection, not a repeated template.</p>
        </header>

        <article class="room-story room-story--red">
          <figure>
            <picture>
              <source sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 62vw" srcset="/images/gridform/compact-640.avif 640w, /images/gridform/compact-1200.avif 1200w" type="image/avif" />
              <source sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 62vw" srcset="/images/gridform/compact-640.webp 640w, /images/gridform/compact-1200.webp 1200w" type="image/webp" />
              <img alt="Compact fictional galley kitchen with red lower cabinetry, warm-white uppers, and stainless counters" decoding="async" height="1024" loading="lazy" src="/images/gridform/compact-1200.webp" width="1536" />
            </picture>
            <figcaption>Concept study / Generated imagery</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="room-copy">
            <p class="room-number">A / 01</p>
            <p class="eyebrow">Compact apartment</p>
            <h3>Redline<br />Galley</h3>
            <p>A narrow kitchen made legible: a continuous stainless work line, storage lifted into the wall, and a single red datum running through the room.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Planning idea</dt><dd>Single-wall rhythm</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Material cue</dt><dd>Red lacquer + steel</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <button type="button" data-project="redline">Read project notes <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="room-story room-story--light">
          <figure>
            <picture>
              <source sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 62vw" srcset="/images/gridform/family-800.avif 800w, /images/gridform/family-1600.avif 1600w" type="image/avif" />
              <source sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 62vw" srcset="/images/gridform/family-800.webp 800w, /images/gridform/family-1600.webp 1600w" type="image/webp" />
              <img alt="Open fictional family kitchen with a signal-red island, pale ash dining table, and garden outlook" decoding="async" height="1024" loading="lazy" src="/images/gridform/family-1600.webp" width="1536" />
            </picture>
            <figcaption>Concept study / Generated imagery</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="room-copy">
            <p class="room-number">B / 02</p>
            <p class="eyebrow">Open family room</p>
            <h3>Longtable<br />Island</h3>
            <p>A red island anchors prep, homework, and the evening handoff. Tall warm-white storage disappears at the edge while pale ash carries the room into dining.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Planning idea</dt><dd>Two social zones</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Material cue</dt><dd>Red lacquer + pale ash</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <button type="button" data-project="longtable">Read project notes <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="room-story room-story--dark">
          <figure>
            <picture>
              <source sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 62vw" srcset="/images/gridform/loft-640.avif 640w, /images/gridform/loft-1200.avif 1200w" type="image/avif" />
              <source sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 62vw" srcset="/images/gridform/loft-640.webp 640w, /images/gridform/loft-1200.webp 1200w" type="image/webp" />
              <img alt="Graphic fictional loft kitchen with graphite cabinets, stainless backsplash, and a red pantry column" decoding="async" height="1024" loading="lazy" src="/images/gridform/loft-1200.webp" width="1536" />
            </picture>
            <figcaption>Concept study / Generated imagery</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="room-copy">
            <p class="room-number">C / 03</p>
            <p class="eyebrow">Industrial loft</p>
            <h3>One-wall<br />Workshop</h3>
            <p>Graphite storage makes the working wall feel architectural. Stainless catches the light; one red pantry column marks the end of the system.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Planning idea</dt><dd>Compressed work wall</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Material cue</dt><dd>Graphite + aluminum</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <button type="button" data-project="workshop">Read project notes <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="system section" id="system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
        <header class="system-head">
          <p class="section-code">03 / The system</p>
          <h2 id="system-title">Four finishes.<br />Fewer wrong turns.</h2>
          <p>Material choices stay deliberately narrow so proportion, usefulness, and workmanship can do more of the visual work.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="material-layout">
          <figure>
            <picture>
              <source sizes="(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/images/gridform/materials-560.avif 560w, /images/gridform/materials-1000.avif 1000w" type="image/avif" />
              <source sizes="(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/images/gridform/materials-560.webp 560w, /images/gridform/materials-1000.webp 1000w" type="image/webp" />
              <img alt="GRIDFORM concept material flatlay with red lacquer, brushed metal, pale ash, warm white, and graphite" decoding="async" height="1024" loading="lazy" src="/images/gridform/materials-1000.webp" width="1024" />
            </picture>
            <figcaption>Concept material library</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="material-controls">
            <div class="material-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Explore concept finishes">
              <button class="is-active" type="button" data-material="Signal lacquer" data-description="A controlled red plane that marks an island, pantry, or working run without becoming decoration." aria-pressed="true"><i class="swatch swatch--signal"></i><span>01</span>Signal lacquer</button>
              <button type="button" data-material="Brushed aluminum" data-description="A practical reflective surface that carries light and gives hard-working zones an exact, professional edge." aria-pressed="false"><i class="swatch swatch--metal"></i><span>02</span>Brushed aluminum</button>
              <button type="button" data-material="Pale ash veneer" data-description="A quiet timber note for tall storage, dining transitions, and the places a hand meets the room." aria-pressed="false"><i class="swatch swatch--ash"></i><span>03</span>Pale ash veneer</button>
              <button type="button" data-material="Warm solid surface" data-description="A low-contrast worktop and cabinet tone that softens the system without blurring its grid." aria-pressed="false"><i class="swatch swatch--white"></i><span>04</span>Warm solid surface</button>
            </div>
            <div class="material-result" aria-live="polite">
              <span>Selected material</span>
              <strong id="material-name">Signal lacquer</strong>
              <p id="material-description">A controlled red plane that marks an island, pantry, or working run without becoming decoration.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="storage-layout">
          <div class="storage-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Inside the grid</p>
            <h3>Storage should explain itself.</h3>
            <p>Pull-outs, work zones, and daily tools sit where their use begins. The outside stays calm because the inside is specific.</p>
            <ol>
              <li><span>01</span><strong>Daily pantry</strong><small>One reach from the worktop</small></li>
              <li><span>02</span><strong>Prep drawer</strong><small>Tools beneath the cutting zone</small></li>
              <li><span>03</span><strong>Waste station</strong><small>Sorted at the sink</small></li>
              <li><span>04</span><strong>Landing shelf</strong><small>A clear place for arrivals</small></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <figure>
            <picture>
              <source sizes="(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/images/gridform/storage-640.avif 640w, /images/gridform/storage-1200.avif 1200w" type="image/avif" />
              <source sizes="(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/images/gridform/storage-640.webp 640w, /images/gridform/storage-1200.webp 1200w" type="image/webp" />
              <img alt="Open red GRIDFORM concept pantry with pale ash pull-out drawers and organized kitchen storage" decoding="async" height="1024" loading="lazy" src="/images/gridform/storage-1200.webp" width="1536" />
            </picture>
            <figcaption>Concept storage detail</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="scope section" id="scope" aria-labelledby="scope-title">
        <header>
          <p class="section-code">04 / Scope sketch</p>
          <h2 id="scope-title">Move the line.<br />Read the range.</h2>
          <p>This estimator demonstrates an interaction a remodeling company might use. It is not a quote, offer, or promise of availability.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="scope-board">
          <div class="scope-inputs">
            <fieldset class="run-control">
              <legend>01 / Cabinet run</legend>
              <div class="run-readout"><strong id="run-value">14</strong><span>linear feet</span></div>
              <input id="run-range" type="range" min="8" max="26" value="14" step="1" aria-label="Cabinet run in linear feet" />
              <div class="range-labels"><span>8 ft</span><span>26 ft</span></div>
            </fieldset>
            <fieldset>
              <legend>02 / Project level</legend>
              <div class="level-options">
                <button type="button" data-level="refresh" aria-pressed="false"><span>Refresh</span><small>Cabinet fronts + surfaces</small></button>
                <button class="is-active" type="button" data-level="rework" aria-pressed="true"><span>Rework</span><small>New plan + fitted system</small></button>
                <button type="button" data-level="bespoke" aria-pressed="false"><span>Bespoke</span><small>Custom details + fabrication</small></button>
              </div>
            </fieldset>
            <div class="install-row">
              <div><strong>Include installation planning</strong><small>Illustrative coordination allowance</small></div>
              <button id="install-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="true"><span>Included</span><i></i></button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="scope-output" aria-live="polite">
            <p>Illustrative project range</p>
            <strong id="scope-range">$38k - $52k</strong>
            <div class="scope-line"><i id="scope-progress"></i></div>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Planning</dt><dd id="planning-time">3 - 4 weeks</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Build window</dt><dd id="build-time">10 - 14 weeks</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Installation</dt><dd id="install-state">Included</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <a class="button button--dark" href="#contact">Turn this into a brief <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
            <small>Demonstration only. No real estimate is being provided.</small>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="process section" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
        <div class="process-intro">
          <p class="section-code">05 / Sequence</p>
          <h2 id="process-title">The work, in a straight line.</h2>
          <p>A useful remodeling site should reveal how decisions move, not hide them behind a form.</p>
        </div>
        <ol>
          <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Measure</h3><p>Walls, services, light, traffic, and the routines the current room interrupts.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Block</h3><p>Test working zones and storage volume before styling the elevations.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Specify</h3><p>Resolve finishes, hardware, appliances, and the exact edges between them.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>04</span><div><h3>Sequence</h3><p>Make decisions and site work visible in one coordinated order.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>05</span><div><h3>Fit</h3><p>Finish the installation with a practical room-by-room review.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="faq section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
        <div>
          <p class="section-code">06 / Read first</p>
          <h2 id="faq-title">Clear from the start.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details><summary>Is GRIDFORM a real remodeling company?</summary><p>No. GRIDFORM Kitchens is a fictional brand and website concept created by PixelFox.design.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Are these finished client projects?</summary><p>No. The rooms, project names, budgets, timelines, and specifications are illustrative portfolio content, not client work or results.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Where did the imagery come from?</summary><p>The photography is original AI-generated concept imagery created specifically for this fictional design direction.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can I request a real quote here?</summary><p>No. The estimator and inquiry form demonstrate a possible customer experience, but no data is sent and no services are offered through this page.</p></details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <p class="section-code">07 / Concept inquiry</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="contact-title">Bring the difficult room.</h2>
          <p>A short brief should begin with the problem, not a catalog of cabinet doors.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="contact-form">
          <label for="contact-email">Email address</label>
          <div><input id="contact-email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required /><button type="submit">Start concept brief</button></div>
          <p id="form-status" role="status">Demo only. Nothing is sent or saved.</p>
        </form>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a class="footer-brand" href="#top"><span>GF</span><strong>GRIDFORM</strong></a>
      <nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="#rooms">Rooms</a><a href="#system">System</a><a href="#scope">Scope</a><a href="/">PixelFox.design</a></nav>
      <p>GRIDFORM Kitchens is a fictional remodeling company concept by PixelFox.design. Projects, services, materials, timelines, budgets, and imagery are design examples only. No services are offered through this page.</p>
    </footer>

    <dialog id="project-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title">
      <button id="dialog-close" type="button">Close</button>
      <p class="eyebrow">Fictional room study</p>
      <h2 id="dialog-title">Redline Galley</h2>
      <p id="dialog-copy">A compact room organized by one continuous working line.</p>
      <a class="button button--signal" href="#scope">Sketch the scope</a>
    </dialog>

    <p class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

    <script>
      const materialButtons = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-material]")];
      const materialName = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#material-name");
      const materialDescription = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#material-description");

      materialButtons.forEach((button) => {
        button.addEventListener("click", () => {
          materialButtons.forEach((item) => {
            const active = item === button;
            item.classList.toggle("is-active", active);
            item.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(active));
          });
          if (materialName) materialName.textContent = button.dataset.material ?? "";
          if (materialDescription) materialDescription.textContent = button.dataset.description ?? "";
        });
      });

      const projectNotes: Record<string, { title: string; copy: string }> = {
        redline: {
          title: "Redline Galley",
          copy: "A compact fictional study that moves storage upward, keeps the worktop continuous, and uses red only where it clarifies the room's working line.",
        },
        longtable: {
          title: "Longtable Island",
          copy: "A fictional family-room study where one generous island handles prep, conversation, homework, and the transition to a pale-ash dining table.",
        },
        workshop: {
          title: "One-wall Workshop",
          copy: "A fictional loft study that compresses appliances, storage, and preparation into one graphite wall, finished with stainless and a red pantry marker.",
        },
      };
      const dialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>("#project-dialog");
      const dialogTitle = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#dialog-title");
      const dialogCopy = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#dialog-copy");
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-project]").forEach((button) => {
        button.addEventListener("click", () => {
          const note = projectNotes[button.dataset.project ?? ""];
          if (!note || !dialog || !dialogTitle || !dialogCopy) return;
          dialogTitle.textContent = note.title;
          dialogCopy.textContent = note.copy;
          dialog.showModal();
        });
      });
      document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#dialog-close")?.addEventListener("click", () => dialog?.close());
      dialog?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
        if (event.target === dialog) dialog.close();
      });

      const rates = {
        refresh: { low: 1.35, high: 1.85, plan: "2 - 3 weeks", build: "5 - 8 weeks" },
        rework: { low: 2.25, high: 3.05, plan: "3 - 4 weeks", build: "10 - 14 weeks" },
        bespoke: { low: 3.45, high: 4.8, plan: "5 - 7 weeks", build: "14 - 20 weeks" },
      };
      let level: keyof typeof rates = "rework";
      let installation = true;
      const runRange = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#run-range");
      const installToggle = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#install-toggle");

      const updateScope = () => {
        if (!runRange) return;
        const run = Number(runRange.value);
        const rate = rates[level];
        const low = Math.round(run * rate.low + (installation ? 6 : 0));
        const high = Math.round(run * rate.high + (installation ? 9 : 0));
        const progress = ((run - 8) / 18) * 100;
        const runValue = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#run-value");
        const scopeRange = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#scope-range");
        const planningTime = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#planning-time");
        const buildTime = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#build-time");
        const installState = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#install-state");
        const scopeProgress = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#scope-progress");
        if (runValue) runValue.textContent = String(run);
        if (scopeRange) scopeRange.textContent = `$${low}k - $${high}k`;
        if (planningTime) planningTime.textContent = rate.plan;
        if (buildTime) buildTime.textContent = rate.build;
        if (installState) installState.textContent = installation ? "Included" : "Planning only";
        if (scopeProgress) scopeProgress.style.width = `${Math.max(8, progress)}%`;
        runRange.style.setProperty("--range-progress", `${progress}%`);
      };

      runRange?.addEventListener("input", updateScope);
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-level]").forEach((button) => {
        button.addEventListener("click", () => {
          level = (button.dataset.level ?? "rework") as keyof typeof rates;
          document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-level]").forEach((item) => {
            const active = item === button;
            item.classList.toggle("is-active", active);
            item.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(active));
          });
          updateScope();
        });
      });
      installToggle?.addEventListener("click", () => {
        installation = !installation;
        installToggle.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(installation));
        installToggle.querySelector("span")!.textContent = installation ? "Included" : "Planning only";
        updateScope();
      });
      updateScope();

      const toast = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#toast");
      let toastTimer: number;
      document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>("#contact-form")?.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
        event.preventDefault();
        const message = "Concept demo only - your information was not sent or saved.";
        const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#form-status");
        if (status) status.textContent = message;
        if (toast) {
          toast.textContent = message;
          toast.classList.add("is-visible");
          window.clearTimeout(toastTimer);
          toastTimer = window.setTimeout(() => toast.classList.remove("is-visible"), 3600);
        }
      });

      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>(".mobile-menu a").forEach((link) => {
        link.addEventListener("click", () => link.closest("details")?.removeAttribute("open"));
      });
    </script>

    <style>
      :root {
        --signal: #e63b2e;
        --signal-dark: #a91d16;
        --ink: #1b1b19;
        --chalk: #f5f2e9;
        --white: #fffefa;
        --metal: #cfd1cd;
        --metal-dark: #8f938f;
        --ash: #d6bea0;
        --muted: #6e6b65;
        --line: rgba(27, 27, 25, 0.27);
        --display: "Bahnschrift", "Aptos Display", "Franklin Gothic Medium", sans-serif;
        --body: "Aptos", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
        --gutter: clamp(20px, 4vw, 80px);
        --page-max: 2240px;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 98px; }
      body { margin: 0; overflow-x: hidden; color: var(--ink); background: var(--chalk); font-family: var(--body); }
      button, input { color: inherit; font: inherit; }
      button, summary { cursor: pointer; }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
      picture { display: block; }
      figure { margin: 0; }
      h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
      h1, h2, h3 { margin-bottom: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; }
      fieldset { min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
      .skip-link { position: fixed; z-index: 1000; top: 8px; left: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); transform: translateY(-160%); }
      .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
      :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #2267ff; outline-offset: 3px; }

      .concept-bar { min-height: 28px; padding: 5px max(var(--gutter), calc((100vw - var(--page-max)) / 2 + 40px)); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); font-size: 8px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .concept-bar p { margin: 0; }
      .concept-bar a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

      .site-header { position: sticky; z-index: 100; top: 0; min-height: 76px; padding: 0 max(var(--gutter), calc((100vw - var(--page-max)) / 2 + 40px)); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); background: rgba(255,254,250,0.96); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
      .brand { width: fit-content; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; }
      .brand-mark { width: 44px; height: 44px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--white); background: var(--signal); font-family: var(--display); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; }
      .brand > span:last-child { display: grid; }
      .brand strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 22px; line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
      .brand small { margin-top: 5px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 7px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .desktop-nav { display: flex; gap: clamp(22px, 3vw, 48px); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .desktop-nav a { position: relative; padding: 30px 0 27px; }
      .desktop-nav a::after { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 20px; left: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--signal); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform 180ms ease; content: ""; }
      .desktop-nav a:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
      .header-cta { min-height: 44px; padding: 0 16px; justify-self: end; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--white); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease; }
      .header-cta:hover { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
      .header-cta span { color: var(--signal); font-size: 18px; }
      .mobile-menu { display: none; }

      .hero { width: min(100%, 2560px); min-height: min(900px, calc(100svh - 104px)); margin-inline: auto; position: relative; display: grid; align-items: end; isolation: isolate; background: var(--metal); }
      .hero-media { position: absolute; z-index: -1; inset: 0; }
      .hero-media picture, .hero-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
      .hero-media img { object-fit: cover; object-position: center 53%; }
      .hero-media::after { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10,10,9,0.2), transparent 58%); content: ""; }
      .hero-media figcaption, .rooms figcaption, .system figcaption { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; padding: 8px 12px; color: var(--white); background: rgba(27,27,25,0.88); font-size: 7px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .hero-panel { width: min(760px, calc(100% - var(--gutter) * 2)); margin: 0 0 clamp(42px, 6vw, 96px) max(var(--gutter), calc((100vw - var(--page-max)) / 2 + 40px)); padding: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 72px); color: var(--ink); background: var(--chalk); }
      .eyebrow, .section-code { margin-bottom: 22px; color: var(--signal-dark); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .hero h1 { max-width: 650px; font-size: clamp(54px, 6vw, 98px); letter-spacing: -0.07em; line-height: 0.85; }
      .hero h1 span { color: var(--signal); }
      .hero-panel > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 600px; margin: 32px 0; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 19px); line-height: 1.55; }
      .hero-code { position: absolute; right: max(var(--gutter), calc((100vw - var(--page-max)) / 2 + 40px)); top: clamp(26px, 4vw, 60px); width: 94px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--ink); }
      .hero-code strong, .hero-code span { aspect-ratio: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 20px; }
      .hero-code strong { color: var(--white); background: var(--signal); }
      .hero-code span { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }

      .button { min-height: 52px; padding: 0 20px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 28px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.11em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .button--signal { color: var(--white); background: var(--signal); }
      .button--signal:hover { background: var(--signal-dark); }
      .button--dark { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }

      .method-rail { max-width: var(--page-max); margin-inline: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); border-left: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--white); }
      .method-rail p { min-height: 116px; margin: 0; padding: 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; align-content: center; gap: 6px 14px; border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .method-rail p:last-child { border-right: 0; }
      .method-rail span { grid-row: span 2; color: var(--signal); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; }
      .method-rail strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 25px); }
      .method-rail small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; }

      .section { padding: clamp(78px, 9vw, 164px) max(var(--gutter), calc((100vw - var(--page-max)) / 2 + 40px)); }
      .manifesto { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(280px, 0.55fr); align-items: start; gap: clamp(34px, 5vw, 92px); background: var(--chalk); }
      .manifesto h2 { max-width: 1400px; font-size: clamp(54px, 6.2vw, 116px); letter-spacing: -0.075em; line-height: 0.9; }
      .manifesto > div { padding-top: 6px; }
      .manifesto > div p { margin-bottom: 38px; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(15px, 1.35vw, 20px); line-height: 1.65; }
      .line-link { padding-bottom: 7px; display: inline-flex; gap: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .line-link span { color: var(--signal); }

      .rooms { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
      .rooms-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(280px, 0.55fr); align-items: end; gap: clamp(34px, 5vw, 92px); }
      .rooms-head .section-code { align-self: start; color: var(--metal); }
      .rooms-head h2 { font-size: clamp(62px, 7vw, 126px); letter-spacing: -0.075em; line-height: 0.85; }
      .rooms-head > p:last-child { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
      .room-story { max-width: var(--page-max); min-height: 760px; margin-inline: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.58fr) minmax(390px, 0.72fr); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
      .room-story:nth-of-type(even) { grid-template-columns: minmax(390px, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.58fr); }
      .room-story:nth-of-type(even) figure { order: 2; }
      .room-story figure { min-width: 0; min-height: 620px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
      .room-story picture, .room-story img { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
      .room-story img { object-fit: cover; transition: transform 700ms ease; }
      .room-story:hover img { transform: scale(1.02); }
      .room-copy { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 84px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .room-story--red .room-copy { color: var(--white); background: var(--signal); }
      .room-story--light .room-copy { color: var(--ink); background: var(--chalk); }
      .room-story--dark .room-copy { color: var(--white); background: #080808; }
      .room-story--red .eyebrow, .room-story--dark .eyebrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.66); }
      .room-number { margin-bottom: auto; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
      .room-copy h3 { font-size: clamp(54px, 5.5vw, 100px); letter-spacing: -0.07em; line-height: 0.82; }
      .room-copy > p:not(.room-number, .eyebrow) { max-width: 610px; margin: 32px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .room-copy dl { width: 100%; margin: 0 0 40px; }
      .room-copy dl div { padding: 12px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; border-top: 1px solid currentColor; }
      .room-copy dt { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.11em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .room-copy dd { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; text-align: right; }
      .room-copy button { width: 100%; margin-top: auto; padding: 15px 0 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid currentColor; color: inherit; background: transparent; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.11em; text-align: left; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .room-copy button span { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 0.6; }

      .system { background: var(--white); }
      .system-head { margin-bottom: clamp(50px, 7vw, 110px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(280px, 0.55fr); align-items: end; gap: clamp(34px, 5vw, 92px); }
      .system-head .section-code { align-self: start; }
      .system-head h2 { font-size: clamp(58px, 6.5vw, 116px); letter-spacing: -0.075em; line-height: 0.86; }
      .system-head > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
      .material-layout { max-width: var(--page-max); margin-inline: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(420px, 0.92fr); border: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .material-layout figure, .storage-layout figure { min-width: 0; min-height: 650px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
      .material-layout figure { border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .material-layout picture, .material-layout img, .storage-layout picture, .storage-layout img { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
      .material-layout img, .storage-layout img { object-fit: cover; }
      .material-controls { min-width: 0; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr; }
      .material-tabs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .material-tabs button { min-width: 0; min-height: 170px; padding: 22px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 46px 30px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 14px; border: 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--white); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-align: left; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .material-tabs button:nth-child(even) { border-right: 0; }
      .material-tabs button.is-active { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
      .material-tabs button > span { color: var(--signal); }
      .swatch { width: 46px; aspect-ratio: 1; display: block; border: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .material-tabs .is-active .swatch { border-color: var(--white); }
      .swatch--signal { background: var(--signal); }
      .swatch--metal { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8e928f, #f1f2ef, #a4a7a4); }
      .swatch--ash { background: #d6bea0; }
      .swatch--white { background: var(--chalk); }
      .material-result { padding: clamp(34px, 4vw, 68px); align-self: stretch; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: var(--metal); }
      .material-result > span { margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--signal-dark); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .material-result strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(34px, 3.5vw, 58px); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.95; }
      .material-result p { max-width: 600px; margin: 24px 0 0; line-height: 1.65; }

      .storage-layout { max-width: var(--page-max); margin: clamp(80px, 10vw, 170px) auto 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(420px, 0.86fr) minmax(0, 1.14fr); border: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .storage-copy { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(40px, 5vw, 84px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--chalk); border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .storage-copy h3 { max-width: 740px; font-size: clamp(50px, 5.2vw, 92px); letter-spacing: -0.07em; line-height: 0.88; }
      .storage-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 650px; margin: 32px 0 42px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }
      .storage-copy ol { margin: auto 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .storage-copy li { padding: 15px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .storage-copy li span { color: var(--signal); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; }
      .storage-copy li strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 18px; }
      .storage-copy li small { color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }

      .scope { color: var(--white); background: var(--signal); }
      .scope > header { margin-bottom: 64px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(280px, 0.55fr); align-items: end; gap: clamp(34px, 5vw, 92px); }
      .scope .section-code { align-self: start; color: var(--white); }
      .scope > header h2 { font-size: clamp(60px, 6.6vw, 118px); letter-spacing: -0.075em; line-height: 0.86; }
      .scope > header > p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
      .scope-board { max-width: var(--page-max); margin-inline: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(390px, 0.7fr); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--chalk); box-shadow: 18px 18px 0 var(--signal-dark); }
      .scope-inputs { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(36px, 5vw, 82px); display: grid; gap: 48px; border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .scope-inputs legend { margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .run-readout { margin-bottom: 28px; display: flex; align-items: end; gap: 13px; }
      .run-readout strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(70px, 7vw, 116px); letter-spacing: -0.07em; line-height: 0.7; }
      .run-readout span { padding-bottom: 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      #run-range { --range-progress: 33.33%; width: 100%; height: 6px; appearance: none; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--signal) var(--range-progress), var(--metal) var(--range-progress)); }
      #run-range::-webkit-slider-thumb { width: 26px; height: 34px; appearance: none; border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--chalk); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }
      #run-range::-moz-range-thumb { width: 26px; height: 34px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 0; background: var(--chalk); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }
      .range-labels { margin-top: 13px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--muted); font-size: 9px; }
      .level-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .level-options button { min-width: 0; min-height: 118px; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; border: 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--white); text-align: left; }
      .level-options button:last-child { border-right: 0; }
      .level-options button.is-active { color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
      .level-options span { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
      .level-options small { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.35; }
      .level-options button.is-active small { color: var(--metal); }
      .install-row { min-height: 82px; padding-top: 22px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .install-row > div { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
      .install-row strong { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .install-row small { color: var(--muted); }
      #install-toggle { min-width: 150px; padding: 10px 10px 10px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--white); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; }
      #install-toggle i { width: 34px; height: 22px; position: relative; display: block; background: var(--metal); }
      #install-toggle i::after { width: 16px; height: 16px; position: absolute; top: 3px; left: 3px; background: var(--ink); transition: transform 150ms ease; content: ""; }
      #install-toggle[aria-pressed="true"] i { background: var(--signal); }
      #install-toggle[aria-pressed="true"] i::after { transform: translateX(12px); }
      .scope-output { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 76px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
      .scope-output > p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--metal); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .scope-output > strong { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(45px, 4.5vw, 72px); letter-spacing: -0.065em; line-height: 0.88; }
      .scope-line { width: 100%; height: 8px; margin: 34px 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); }
      .scope-line i { width: 33.33%; height: 100%; display: block; background: var(--signal); transition: width 180ms ease; }
      .scope-output dl { width: 100%; margin: 0 0 38px; }
      .scope-output dl div { padding: 14px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
      .scope-output dt { color: var(--metal); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .scope-output dd { margin: 0; text-align: right; }
      .scope-output .button { width: 100%; margin-top: auto; border-color: var(--white); background: var(--signal); }
      .scope-output > small { margin-top: 14px; color: var(--metal); font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.5; text-transform: uppercase; }

      .process { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(340px, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); gap: clamp(60px, 10vw, 180px); background: var(--metal); }
      .process-intro { position: sticky; top: 120px; height: fit-content; }
      .process-intro h2 { max-width: 740px; font-size: clamp(58px, 6vw, 108px); letter-spacing: -0.075em; line-height: 0.87; }
      .process-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 560px; margin: 34px 0 0; line-height: 1.65; }
      .process ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .process li { min-height: 170px; padding: 30px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 76px 0.55fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .process li > span { color: var(--signal); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; }
      .process h3 { font-size: clamp(34px, 3.7vw, 60px); letter-spacing: -0.055em; }
      .process li p { max-width: 560px; margin: 0; color: #4e4e4a; line-height: 1.6; }

      .faq { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr); gap: clamp(60px, 10vw, 180px); background: var(--white); }
      .faq h2 { max-width: 650px; font-size: clamp(58px, 6vw, 108px); letter-spacing: -0.075em; line-height: 0.87; }
      .faq-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .faq details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
      .faq summary { min-height: 96px; padding: 24px 60px 24px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; position: relative; list-style: none; font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 30px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
      .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
      .faq summary::after { position: absolute; right: 4px; color: var(--signal); font-family: var(--body); font-size: 24px; content: "+"; }
      .faq details[open] summary::after { content: "-"; }
      .faq details p { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 0 30px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }

      .contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(400px, 0.9fr); align-items: end; gap: clamp(34px, 5vw, 92px); color: var(--white); background: var(--signal); }
      .contact .section-code { align-self: start; color: var(--white); }
      .contact h2 { max-width: 940px; font-size: clamp(58px, 6.5vw, 116px); letter-spacing: -0.075em; line-height: 0.85; }
      .contact > div > p { max-width: 620px; margin: 28px 0 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .contact label { display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .contact form > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
      .contact input { min-width: 0; min-height: 58px; padding: 0 17px; border: 1px solid var(--white); background: transparent; color: var(--white); }
      .contact input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); }
      .contact form button { padding: 0 22px; border: 1px solid var(--white); color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .contact form > p { margin: 11px 0 0; font-size: 9px; }

      footer { padding: 54px max(var(--gutter), calc((100vw - var(--page-max)) / 2 + 40px)) 34px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 40px; color: var(--white); background: var(--ink); }
      .footer-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
      .footer-brand span { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--signal); font-size: 14px; }
